  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Manappuram Finance Q2 results: Profit jumps over 3-fold to ₹701 crore",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/companies/quarterly-results/manappuram-finance-q2-results-profit-jumps-over-3-fold-to-701-crore-126111201273_1.html",
      "description": "Gold loan financier Manappuram Finance Ltd on Thursday reported a more than three-fold year-on-year increase in its consolidated profit after tax (PAT) to Rs 701 crore for the September quarter of FY27.\nThe company had posted a PAT of Rs 217.31 crore in the corresponding quarter of the previous fiscal. On a sequential basis, net profit rose 20 per cent from Rs 585 crore in the June quarter.\nTotal income increased to Rs 3,312 crore in the second quarter of FY27, compared to Rs 2,275 crore in the year-ago period, the company said in a regulatory filing.\nThe company's total assets under management (AUM) stood at Rs 73,303 crore as of September 2026, registering a year-on-year growth of 60 per cent.\nGold Loan AUM surged 92.5 per cent YoY to Rs 60,640 crore at the end of the September quarter.\nShares of Manappuram Finance settled 0.23 per cent lower at Rs 320.25 apiece on the BSE.",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-11-12T17:54:27"
    },
    {
      "title": "Ramayana storms past 500 crore in India, global earnings near Rs 935 crore",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/entertainment/ramayana-box-office-day-8-storms-past-500-crore-in-india-global-earnings-near-rs-935-crore-nc-126111200950_1.html",
      "description": "Ramayana: Rise of a Legend has maintained its strong box-office run since its November 5 release, earning Rs 511.10 crore net in India and Rs 934.55 crore gross worldwide in its first week.",
